        "output": "chosen 3 rejected 0: loss 0.0486\nchosen 1 rejected 0: loss 0.3133\nchosen 0 rejected 0: loss 0.6931\nchosen 0 rejected 1: loss 1.3133\nchosen 0 rejected 3: loss 3.0486",
